# Hayabusa, Crimson Shadow

> Hayabusa is an isolation assassin. He is designed to stack all four Shadow Marks on one target, delete that target, and leave before the fight starts, because the ult's hits are drawn to marked enemies. If your draft cannot create a window where one target carries every mark, Hayabusa is the wrong jungler.

