## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle Pickoff Default (Jungle)

- Items: Magic Boots, Hunter Strike, Blade of the Heptaseas, Sky Piercer, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: Hunter Strike, Blade of the Heptaseas, Sky Piercer
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Magic Boots when Use when chain crowd control is the reason Quad Shadow exits fail.; Blade of Despair over Immortality when Use when Hayabusa is ahead and the enemy lacks instant lock-on punishment after the ult.; Rose Gold Meteor over Immortality when Use against magic burst when a shield and movement burst save the first dive better than a revive.
- Total cost: 10350 gold

Default jungle setup for isolating one side-lane target, cycling Hunter Strike movement speed, and using Ice Retribution to keep the marked target inside the ult circle.

### Snowball Execute (Jungle)

- Items: Swift Boots, Sky Piercer, Blade of the Heptaseas, Hunter Strike, Blade of Despair, Malefic Roar
- Core: Sky Piercer, Blade of the Heptaseas, Hunter Strike
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Flame Retribution
- Flex: Magic Boots over Swift Boots when Use when cooldown cycling matters more than early attack-speed tempo.; Immortality over Blade of Despair when Use once shutdown risk is higher than the value of the last raw damage slot.; Sea Halberd over Blade of Despair when Use when a healer, shield support, or high-extra-HP fighter keeps surviving the execute window.
- Total cost: 11240 gold

High-risk snowball setup for early-kill games where Hayabusa protects Sky Piercer stacks and Flame Retribution adds one more burst swing against the carry.

### Anti-Armor Reset (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Hunter Strike, War Axe, Endless Battle, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: Hunter Strike, War Axe, Malefic Roar
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, War Cry
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Blade of the Heptaseas over Endless Battle when Use when the enemy backline is still the real target and you need a stronger first hit from fog.; Queen's Wings over Endless Battle when Use when Hayabusa must survive repeated counter-burst after the first Shadow Kill.; Sea Halberd over Endless Battle when Use when sustain or shield value is stopping the first marked target from dying.
- Total cost: 11320 gold

Anti-front-line setup for games where Hayabusa still needs pickoffs, but enemy armor and sustain force longer reset fights around objectives.

